Read `AGENTS.md` and `skills/ludicord/SKILL.md` before Ludicord work. Use the Activity's installed declarations and `ludicord.generated.d.ts` as the API authority. Preserve Ludicord file conventions, typed embed navigation, normal React lifecycle rules, and client/server security boundaries. Never import `ludicord/internal` or edit generated output. Run applicable validation and a production build before reporting success.
